{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-perpusgateway1",
    "name": "Perpustakaan-Gateway",
    "description": "Fase 6: pengujian end-to-end Sistem Peminjaman Buku lewat api-gateway (:3000).\n\nCARA PAKAI:\n1. Postman -> Import -> Folder -> pilih folder postman/ (collection + environment ikut masuk).\n2. Pilih environment \"Local\" di kanan atas.\n3. Pastikan 4 service jalan (auth :3003, catalog :3001, loan :3002, gateway :3000) + MySQL + SQL sudah diimport.\n4. Kirim request \"Login MHS001\" dulu (mengisi variabel jwt), lalu Collection Runner dari atas ke bawah.\n\nUrutan penting: 0-Health -> 1-Auth (login dulu) -> 2-Catalog -> 3-Loans (pinjam mengisi loanId, return di akhir) -> 4-Security negatif.\nJika request \"Pinjam B001\" dapat 409, berarti buku masih dipinjam dari run sebelumnya: jalankan \"Return\" dulu, lalu ulangi dari \"Pinjam\".\nSumber kebenaran pengujian adalah collection ini (lihat PRD Fase 6).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0-Health",
      "description": "Cek gateway + agregat status ketiga service. Semua harus hijau sebelum lanjut.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Gateway",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway}}/health",
              "host": ["{{gateway}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "GET /health gateway: agregat /health auth :3003, catalog :3001, loan :3002. 200 = semua ok, 503 = degraded."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"success true + service api-gateway\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.service).to.eql(\"api-gateway\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"auth, catalog, loan semua ok\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.services.auth.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.services.catalog.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.services.loan.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
